k you for your understanding.\n\nBest regards,\nAirline Service"}, "name": "send_message", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_017v9LH66aXk8H1gb33zhy7V", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"user_id": "7003", "text": "Dear Ines Faro,\n\nFlight AL900 on September 20, 2026 has been cancelled. Unfortunately, as your reservation R-3003 is a basic economy ticket, which cannot be changed, we have cancelled your reservation with a full refund. Please contact our customer service team if you would like to rebook on another flight.\n\nWe apologize for this inconvenience.\n\nBest regards,\nAirline Service"}, "name": "send_message", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Mb7vqUvhDA5wgbKVGAhFrN", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"user_id": "7004", "text": "Dear Omar Haddad,\n\nFlight AL900 on September 20, 2026 has been cancelled. As requested in your reservation notes, we have processed a full refund for reservation R-3004 instead of rebooking you on another flight. The refund will be processed within 5-7 business days.\n\nWe apologize for this disruption.\n\nBest regards,\nAirline Service"}, "name": "send_message", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_016997EHfbhyyDehoum9reSi", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"user_id": "7005", "text": "Dear Rosa Lind,\n\nDue to the cancellation of flight AL900 on September 20, 2026, we have rebooked you on flight AL708 departing Seattle at 09:50 and arriving in Boston at 18:15 (local time). Your reservation R-3005 has been updated. We apologize for this disruption and thank you for your understanding.\n\nBest regards,\nAirline Service"}, "name": "send_message", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}], "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "not_available", "input_tokens": 4084, "output_tokens": 766, "output_tokens_details": nu